WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.380
Modern ethical publishing requires a
constant multivariable balancing act.

2
00:00:05.840 --> 00:00:09.680
Resolving the intense pressures of the
modern landscape demands an unwavering

3
00:00:09.720 --> 00:00:14.080
commitment to both individual human
accountability and rigorous institutional

4
00:00:14.120 --> 00:00:18.860
transparency. Artificial intelligence,
corporate funding, and the aggressive

5
00:00:18.900 --> 00:00:23.580
push for proprietary control are permanent,
escalating fixtures in the future

6
00:00:23.620 --> 00:00:28.460
of research. Despite these modern
complexities, the defense of academic

7
00:00:28.500 --> 00:00:32.820
freedom and the pursuit of the public good
remains the paramount ethical duty

8
00:00:32.860 --> 00:00:35.000
of every individual researcher.

9
00:00:35.760 --> 00:00:39.460
Preserving trust in the scientific record
is not an automatic outcome.

10
00:00:39.500 --> 00:00:43.760
It is a deliberate, ongoing choice that
requires constant vigilance.
